{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just Keep Digging is an open-world action-adventure mining simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as John in Bodie, a company mining town. Meet the weekly profit quota or face termination. Use extra company coins to upgrade your gear, dig deeper for rarer resources, and uncover ancient fossils and ruined structures. Beware of dangerous cave dwellers\u2014bring a weapon along with your pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Mine_Text.png?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Player_Mining_2.gif?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine for materials in a procedurally generated world and sell them to meet the company\u2019s weekly profit quotas. Use extra coins to upgrade your gear and dig deeper for rarer and more valuable resources. Complete your catalog by discovering all types of materials while navigating the dangers of the underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Upgrade_Text.png?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Pick_Upgrade__2_.gif?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After returning from a mining expedition, sell your materials at the marketplace or to the trader to earn money. Use your earnings to buy upgrades at the store: a better pickaxe to break blocks faster, a stronger headlamp to see further, torches to light your path, a larger backpack to hold more items, better gloves to swing the pickaxe quicker, dynamite to blow up large areas, rails for faster travel in and out of the mine, and many more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Fight_Text.png?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/RunningFromCowWorm_2.gif?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Not yet implemented in demo</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While digging for materials, you might encounter foes along the way. Be sure to bring not just a pickaxe but a weapon as well; you'll need it to fend off all the creatures that get in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Discover_Text.png?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Not yet implemented in demo</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your journey to find the rarest materials, you may stumble across ancient ruined structures, fossilized bones, large twisting caves, and dungeons full of valuable loot. Each discovery not only adds to your findings but also boosts the company's wealth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974660?t=1744854836","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744854836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744854836","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744854836","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3060230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rewards - Games - Beta Test - News - Community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/DiscordLink__2_.gif?t=1744854836\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just Keep Digging is an open-world action-adventure mining simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as John in Bodie, a company mining town. Meet the weekly profit quota or face termination. Use extra company coins to upgrade your gear, dig deeper for rarer resources, and uncover ancient fossils and ruined structures. Beware of dangerous cave dwellers\u2014bring a weapon along with your pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Mine_Text.png?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Player_Mining_2.gif?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine for materials in a procedurally generated world and sell them to meet the company\u2019s weekly profit quotas. Use extra coins to upgrade your gear and dig deeper for rarer and more valuable resources. Complete your catalog by discovering all types of materials while navigating the dangers of the underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Upgrade_Text.png?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Pick_Upgrade__2_.gif?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After returning from a mining expedition, sell your materials at the marketplace or to the trader to earn money. Use your earnings to buy upgrades at the store: a better pickaxe to break blocks faster, a stronger headlamp to see further, torches to light your path, a larger backpack to hold more items, better gloves to swing the pickaxe quicker, dynamite to blow up large areas, rails for faster travel in and out of the mine, and many more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Fight_Text.png?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/RunningFromCowWorm_2.gif?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Not yet implemented in demo</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While digging for materials, you might encounter foes along the way. Be sure to bring not just a pickaxe but a weapon as well; you'll need it to fend off all the creatures that get in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/extras/Discover_Text.png?t=1744854836\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Not yet implemented in demo</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your journey to find the rarest materials, you may stumble across ancient ruined structures, fossilized bones, large twisting caves, and dungeons full of valuable loot. Each discovery not only adds to your findings but also boosts the company's wealth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Relt"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/header.jpg?t=1744854836","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Just Keep Digging","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["RELT Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q2 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/4277127ceaa40c1ec278ce0f90fbfe3df0dec8ec/ss_4277127ceaa40c1ec278ce0f90fbfe3df0dec8ec.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744854836","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/4277127ceaa40c1ec278ce0f90fbfe3df0dec8ec/ss_4277127ceaa40c1ec278ce0f90fbfe3df0dec8ec.600x338.jpg?t=1744854836"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/6905642911596ed54217554c559fc0ae94a70d2d/ss_6905642911596ed54217554c559fc0ae94a70d2d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744854836","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/6905642911596ed54217554c559fc0ae94a70d2d/ss_6905642911596ed54217554c559fc0ae94a70d2d.600x338.jpg?t=1744854836"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/b1969200fcb19761fbdf817fc59d613e3c38ae91/ss_b1969200fcb19761fbdf817fc59d613e3c38ae91.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744854836","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974660/b1969200fcb19761fbdf817fc59d613e3c38ae91/ss_b1969200fcb19761fbdf817fc59d613e3c38ae91.600x338.jpg?t=1744854836"},{"id":3,"path_full":"htt